/**************************/
/* STYLING - GENERAL */
/**************************/


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]


*{
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  
}

@font-face {
    font-family: "Courier Prime";
    src: url("fonts/CourierPrime-Regular.ttf");
}

body {
  font-family: "Courier Prime";
  margin: 0;
  display: flex;
  height: 100%;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

html, body{
  height:100%;
}

main{
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;             
    flex-direction: column;    
    justify-content: center;   
    align-items: center;      
    text-align: center;
}
      
a{
    text-decoration: none;
}

.nav-img{
  width: 250px;
  height: 80px;
  padding: 10px 10px 0px 10px;
  margin: 10px 10px 10px 0px;
}

li:hover{
    text-decoration: underline;
}

.logo-img{
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    margin: 0px 10px 10px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
}


h1{
    display: inline-block;
    color: black;
    font-size: 50px;
    padding: 20px 20px 20px 20px;
    background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
    margin: 20px 0px 10px 0px;
    font-family: "TypoSlab Main";
    border-radius: 20px;
}

.buttons{
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    }

.button{
    margin: 15px 40px;
    padding: 15px 60px;
    font-size: 25px;
    width: 250px;
    background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
    color: black;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-family: "Courier Prime";
    border-color: purple;
}


.button:hover{
    cursor: pointer;
    background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);
}


footer{
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  margin-top: auto;
}

footer h3{
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 40px;
  font-family: "TypoSlab Main";
  color: black;
}

footer img{
  width: 150px;
}

.col-1{
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-around;
  color: black;
  font-family: "Courier Prime";
  padding: 10px 10px 15px 10px;
}
.col-1 p{
  text-align: center;
}

.passage[data-passage="landing"] {
  background-image: url("src/assets/img/woods1_edited.png");
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
}

/**************************/
/* STYLING - MUSIC TUTORIAL */
/**************************/

.passage[data-passage="music tutorial"] .music-tut-img{
  width: 300px;
  height: auto;
}

.passage[data-passage="music tutorial"] a img{
  width: 40px;
  height: auto;
}

/**************************/
/* STYLING - PASSAGE #1 */
/**************************/

.passage[data-passage="name_set1"]{
  background-image:url("src/assets/img/bw_gradient.jpg");
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
}

/**************************/
/* START OF PRE-NARRATIVE */
/**************************/


:: name_set1
<<cacheaudio title src/assets/music/Title.mp3>>
<<masteraudio volume 0.25>>
<<audio "title" loop play>>
/* Gradient from black to white after some scrolling, then the below.*/


















































































































<<type 30ms>>
\> You're finally here.

\> This story is about you. What should we call you?


\>> I think... I think you can call me <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_confirm">>

<</type>>

:: name_confirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to false>>

<<type 30ms>>
\> $name. A lot is going to happen, $name.

\> If it's any consolation, it's all in your hands.


\>> [[[Wait. I think I might be someone else?|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[.. What do you mean? What is this?|question2]]]

<</type>>

:: name_reselect

<<type 30ms>>

\> It's so easy to forget, isn't it? Who are you, then?

\>> <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_reconfirm">> That's it.


<</type>>

:: name_reconfirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to true>>

<<type 30ms>>
\> You know this for sure, $name?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[.. One more time.|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[Yes. I do.|question2]]]

<</type>>

:: question2

<<type 30ms>>  /* REQUIRES VARIABLES TO CONTROL THE BOTTOM TWO OPTIONS */

<<if $name_resel is true and not $customEnrapture>>

\> Wonderful. We need to know - what enraptures you?

<<elseif $customEnrapture and not $scarePrompt is true>>

\> Oh, I don't doubt it. Try again though.

<<elseif $scarePrompt is true>>

\> We must be, yes. We're sorry, but this is the way forward. For you.

<<elseif $name_resel is false>>

\> You'll see in due time. For now, we must know - what enraptures you?
<<else>>

<</if>>
/* Need to turn these into buttons then set a variable based on the answer IF it ends up doing anything */
\>> [[Pure darkness as far as I can see.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[A grating, droning noise - somehow from everywhere and nowhere.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[A cold so intense, I can't even feel it.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[Losing myself in a tangle of endless corridors.|pre-wakeup]]

<<if not $customEnrapture>>
\>> No.. It must be <<textbox "$customEnrapture" "" "question2">>
<</if>>
<<if not $scarePrompt is true>>
\>> [[You're starting to scare me??|question2][$scarePrompt to true]]
<</if>>


<</type>>

:: pre-wakeup

<<type 30ms>>
\> Wonderful. You're doing so well. Are you ready?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[Yes.|wakeup]]]

\>> [[[No! What is this? What's happening??|pre-wakeup]]]

<</type>>

/*******************/
/* AFTER WAKING UP */
/*******************/

:: wakeup
[img[You look up at the trees.|src/assets/img/act1/wakeup_still.png]]


:: wakeup2
<video width="100%" autoplay muted>
  <source src="src/assets/video/getup_pt1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  Your browser does not support video.
</video>

